      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is definitely a much-needed feature.\n\nBesides group collabs, it's also helpful for world creators promoting groups hosting in their world. I would be able to link the group's instance in my world's group and therefore users won't have to search for the world.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
